      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "YES please... the item-SPAM over the holidays was SO annoying!\n\nRehashing my post out of #feature-requests:\n\nI'd LOVE to be able get rid of item-spam in general, as mere user even if it isnt my instance.\n\nKinda annoyed being forced to disable a myriad of randomly dropped items one by one (have fun trying to select specific ones in a stack sitting ontop of eachother)\n\nI mean, I get the \"user-paid-for-content\"-argument... yet I can hide any avatar with one click no matter by whom/where/how many times its being used - even tho it might've been paid for aswell.\n\nBut for example countless reference cubes?\n\nNah, gotta disable every single one seperately 😐\n\nIMHO items belong into safety/shield-levels, just like drones, custom images, animations etc...",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
