      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "On the topic of bought/VRC+ things. The party popper join item is VERY overstimulating. I am very sensitive to sudden noises and entering a dropped portal with a bunch of people with VRC+ was.... intense for me to say the least. With no way to disable the noise or the spam of objects popping up in my face. I had to get off after experiencing it constantly in a row like that.\n\nI would like an option to fully disable both the noise and the popper object fully if possible.... Makes me not want to risk even joining private events since a majority of people will have it.\n\nPossibly an option to fully block the item spawns entirely instead of one at a time since they are abused and spammed like crazy even in private instances. Having to disable them one by one just ruins the fun and experience especially if its in an explore world",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
